# `pron` is partial: absent on every out-of-vocabulary token, because the
# surface does not determine a pronunciation.
#
# The `text` conjunct names a string no committed fixture contains, so this
# publishes nothing against the repository parity baseline. What the
# `coverage` command reads is the authored *site*, not what it matches.
pattern exposed := [text=zzqqxx & unidic.pron!=ヨミ].
